WEBVTT

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:10.120
I'm 74. Diabetes, presión alta, the whole package.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:15.620
Mi plan de Medicare Advantage covers my medicines, el eye doctor, hasta la transportación a la clínica.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:21.620
My sister in Orlando pays more y le dan menos.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:27.620
My dad is 86. A nurse from his plan comes to the house every month.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.620
She checks his blood pressure, his feet, his pills.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.620
Three years without going to the hospital. That's the outcome.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:40.620
96% of our seniors are on Medicare Advantage, and Washington pays us 41% less.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:50.420
In our pharmacies, we make sure patients stay adherent to their therapies, and we work hand in hand with the doctors to make sure every patient is in compliance.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:58.600
Find us on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, Amazon Music, iHeartRadio and YouTube, wherever you get your podcasts.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.900
The Healthcare Paradox starts now.
